# Production access

Ask the user and wait for a yes before any SSH, deploy, or change on production (Lightsail `18.141.202.28`, user `ubuntu`).

Do not dump `.env`, mail passwords, DOKU keys, or `APP_KEY` values. Say only whether a secret is set.
